<title>CHINA: Dongfang Elec 1996 interim net falls.</title>
<headline>Dongfang Elec 1996 interim net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996 (in millions of yuan unless stated):</p>
<p> Turnover	  251.706	  vs	  204.896</p>
<p> Net profit	 28.357	  vs	   34.363</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.06 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Net asset per share	2.66 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Company name: Dongfang Electrical Machinery Co Ltd is a power generator producer.</p>
<p>Note: the figures are unaudited.</p>
</text>
